sound_ym_envelope_key_on_off The display is off, so the VBlank poll ends at once and key-off follows key-on within a few microseconds (well under one YM2612 sample). ymfm starts the attack at the key-on write and then releases (audible decay); BlastEm produces no note. How the chip treats a sub-sample key-on pulse is not established here (hardware-unverified).
